+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+Measured end to end (process start through exit) with `muninn-bench perf`, using a
+5,000-record store, 15,000 cues, a release build, and 300 hook invocations on
+2026-09-14:
+
+| Health-gate read path | SessionStart p50 |
+| --- | ---: |
+| Before: live `PRAGMA quick_check`, live FTS row count, and the body-length query | 5.586 ms |
+| After: recorded `quick_check` result, trigger-maintained `fts_rows`, and body length enforced by the schema `CHECK` | 1.016 ms |
+
+The “before” result was measured by running the same benchmark with the hook's
+health report in live mode, which exercises the three checks removed from the read
+path. The “after” result is the current hook. These are measurements from this
+checkout and machine, not estimates; the change reduced the measured p50 by
+4.570 ms (81.8%).
